@@ -302,3 +302,10 @@ Scope policy: this file holds cross-cutting rules, workflows, and gotchas that m
 - NEVER `git push` unless explicitly told to push. "Commit" means commit
   locally only; committing is not permission to push.
 
+
+## Experimental Switch host integration
+
+RTDink's Switch build reuses the Linux/SDL backend with `__SWITCH__` guards.
+SDL requests GLES1.1; platform headers, texture formats, sockets and cwd differ
+from Linux. Standard SDL controller mappings apply (not Raspberry Pi remapping).
+The owning RTDink checkout stores this SDK delta in `switch/patches/proton-switch.patch`.
